  "This runs the sequence with real SPL token transfers, and on failure executes real on-chain compensating transactions for the steps already completed. Nothing is deleted — a chain cannot delete. Each compensation is a new, independently verifiable transaction, and the token balances return to where they started.": "Din id-demo tħaddem is-sekwenza bi trasferimenti reali ta' tokens SPL, u meta jkun hemm falliment twettaq tranżazzjonijiet ta' kumpens reali fuq il-blockchain għall-passi li jkunu diġà tlestew. Xejn ma jitħassar — blockchain ma tistax tħassar. Kull kumpens huwa tranżazzjoni ġdida li tista' tiġi vverifikata b'mod indipendenti, u l-bilanċi tat-tokens jerġgħu lura fejn bdew.",
