  "A guided walkthrough of this page will be posted here.": "Hawn se tiġi ppubblikata gwida ta' din il-paġna.",
  "EXIT FULL SCREEN": "OĦROĠ MILL-ISKRIN SĦIĦ",
  "iPhone Safari cannot hide its bars for web pages. For full screen: tap Share, choose Add to Home Screen, then open this page from the new icon.": "Safari fuq l-iPhone ma jistax jaħbi l-bars tiegħu fuq il-paġni web. Għal skrin sħiħ: agħfas Share, agħżel Add to Home Screen, imbagħad iftaħ din il-paġna mill-ikona l-ġdida.",
  "HOW TO USE THIS DEMO": "KIF TUŻA DIN ID-DEMO",
  "INSTALL PHANTOM": "INSTALLA PHANTOM",
  "Install the Phantom browser extension and create a wallet. The demo uses only the devnet test network — never real funds.": "Installa l-estensjoni tal-browser Phantom u oħloq wallet. Id-demo tuża biss in-netwerk tat-test devnet — qatt flus reali.",
  "SWITCH TO DEVNET": "AQLEB GĦAL DEVNET",
  "In Phantom: Settings → Developer Settings → set the network to Solana Devnet.": "F'Phantom: Settings → Developer Settings → issettja n-netwerk għal Solana Devnet.",
  "GET TEST SOL": "IKSEB SOL TAT-TEST",
  "Get free devnet SOL from any faucet, e.g. faucet.solana.com. It has no monetary value.": "Ikseb SOL tad-devnet b'xejn minn kwalunkwe faucet, eż. faucet.solana.com. M'għandux valur monetarju.",
  "CONNECT WALLET": "QABBAD IL-WALLET",
  "Click CONNECT in the wallet panel below and approve in Phantom.": "Ikklikkja QABBAD fil-pannell tal-wallet hawn taħt u approva f'Phantom.",
  "RUN SETUP": "ĦADDEM IS-SETUP",
  "Click RUN SETUP to mint a test token and open the accounts. Approve both Phantom prompts. Costs about 0.02 devnet SOL.": "Ikklikkja ĦADDEM IS-SETUP biex toħroġ token tat-test u tiftaħ il-kontijiet. Approva ż-żewġ talbiet ta' Phantom. Jiswa madwar 0.02 SOL tad-devnet.",
  "CHOOSE FAILURE MODE": "AGĦŻEL IL-MODALITÀ TAL-FALLIMENT",
  "Choose NONE to run all three steps, or FAIL AT 2 / 3 to force a failure and watch the completed steps get compensated on-chain. FAIL AT 1 fails before any transaction is sent, so there is nothing to compensate. Then click EXECUTE FLOW.": "Agħżel XEJN biex tħaddem it-tliet passi kollha, jew FALLIMENT FIL-PASS 2 / 3 biex iġġiegħel falliment u tara l-passi lesti jiġu kkumpensati fuq il-blockchain. FALLIMENT FIL-PASS 1 ifalli qabel ma tintbagħat kwalunkwe tranżazzjoni, għalhekk ma hemm xejn x'jiġi kkumpensat. Imbagħad ikklikkja ĦADDEM IL-FLUSS.",
  "WATCH & VERIFY": "OSSERVA U IVVERIFIKA",
  "Watch the step panel and the TOKEN ACCOUNTS balances. Every signature links to Solscan for independent verification.": "Osserva l-pannell tal-passi u l-bilanċi tal-KONTIJIET TAT-TOKENS. Kull firma għandha link għal Solscan għal verifika indipendenti.",
  "DOWNLOAD THE LOG": "NIŻŻEL IR-REĠISTRU",
  "Every run is saved in this browser and survives a refresh. Click DOWNLOAD LOG for a text record or DOWNLOAD CSV for a spreadsheet; CLEAR removes the saved runs.": "Kull tħaddim jiġi ssejvjat f'dan il-browser u jibqa' wara refresh. Ikklikkja NIŻŻEL IR-REĠISTRU għal rekord bit-test jew NIŻŻEL CSV għal spreadsheet; NADDAF ineħħi t-tħaddimiet issejvjati.",
  "If a step shows a retry or waiting message, do not click or refresh — the engine checks transaction status and recovers on its own. Keep the Phantom panel open during a run; Phantom locks itself after about 15 minutes of inactivity.": "Jekk pass juri messaġġ ta' tentattiv ieħor jew ta' stennija, tikklikkjax u tagħmilx refresh — il-magna tiċċekkja l-istatus tat-tranżazzjoni u tirkupra waħedha. Żomm il-pannell ta' Phantom miftuħ waqt it-tħaddim; Phantom jissakkar waħdu wara madwar 15-il minuta ta' inattività.",
  "WALLET": "WALLET",
  "SETUP": "SETUP",
  "FAILURE INJECTION": "INJEZZJONI TA' FALLIMENT",
  "RUN": "TĦADDIM",
  "RUN LOG": "REĠISTRU TAT-TĦADDIM",
  "CONNECT": "QABBAD",
  "RE-RUN SETUP": "ĦADDEM IS-SETUP MILL-ĠDID",
