  "DOWNLOAD LOG": "NIŻŻEL IR-REĠISTRU",
  "DOWNLOAD CSV": "NIŻŻEL CSV",
  "CLEAR": "NADDAF",
  "Remove all saved runs from this browser? Download them first if you need a copy.": "Tneħħi t-tħaddimiet kollha ssejvjati minn dan il-browser? Niżżilhom l-ewwel jekk għandek bżonn kopja.",
  "executed": "eżegwiti",
