  "BALANCE CHECK: FAIL": "VERIFIKA TAL-BILANĊI: FALLIET",
  "BALANCE CHECK: N/A": "VERIFIKA TAL-BILANĊI: M/A",
  "+ {0} earlier run(s) in the downloads": "+ {0} tħaddim(iet) preċedenti fid-downloads",
  "Demo updated:": "Demo aġġornata:",
  "— run history saved in the browser, CSV export, and a per-run balance check.": "— l-istorja tat-tħaddim issejvjata fil-browser, esportazzjoni CSV u verifika tal-bilanċi għal kull tħaddim.",
  "Creates a test SPL token, mints {0} to your account, and opens an escrow and a recipient account. Two wallet prompts. Needed once before running the flow.": "Joħloq token SPL tat-test, joħroġ {0} fil-kont tiegħek, u jiftaħ kont escrow u kont tar-riċevitur. Żewġ talbiet tal-wallet. Meħtieġ darba qabel ma tħaddem il-fluss.",
  "NONE": "XEJN",
  "FAIL AT {0}": "FALLIMENT FIL-PASS {0}",
  "Force a step to fail, to demonstrate compensation.": "Iġġiegħel pass ifalli, biex turi l-kumpens.",
  "Flow ID:": "ID tal-fluss:",
  "Every saved run, with signatures, balances and a balance check. Saved in this browser only and kept after a refresh. Downloads are in English: a text log or a CSV spreadsheet.": "Kull tħaddim issejvjat, bil-firem, il-bilanċi u verifika tal-bilanċi. Issejvjat f'dan il-browser biss u jinżamm wara refresh. Id-downloads huma bl-Ingliż: reġistru bit-test jew spreadsheet CSV.",
  "No Phantom wallet detected. Install the Phantom extension and switch it to Devnet.": "Ma nstab l-ebda wallet Phantom. Installa l-estensjoni Phantom u aqlibha għal Devnet.",
  "Wallet connected. Make sure Phantom is set to Devnet.": "Il-wallet huwa mqabbad. Kun żgur li Phantom huwa ssettjat għal Devnet.",
  "Connection cancelled.": "Il-konnessjoni ġiet ikkanċellata.",
  "Connect a wallet first.": "Qabbad wallet l-ewwel.",
