  "Creating token and accounts — the wallet will prompt twice…": "Qed jinħolqu t-token u l-kontijiet — il-wallet se jitlob darbtejn…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for setup. Request more at faucet.solana.com (setup needs about 0.02 SOL).": "M'hemmx biżżejjed SOL tad-Devnet għas-setup. Itlob aktar minn faucet.solana.com (is-setup jeħtieġ madwar 0.02 SOL).",
  "Setup complete. {0} test tokens minted to your account.": "Setup lest. {0} tokens tat-test ġew maħruġa fil-kont tiegħek.",
  "Setup failed:": "Is-setup falla:",
  "Running…": "Għaddej…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for fees. Request more at faucet.solana.com and try again.": "M'hemmx biżżejjed SOL tad-Devnet għat-tariffi. Itlob aktar minn faucet.solana.com u erġa' pprova.",
  "Your token account holds {0}, and this flow moves {1}. Run SETUP again to mint a fresh allocation.": "Il-kont tat-token tiegħek fih {0}, u dan il-fluss iċaqlaq {1}. Ħaddem is-SETUP mill-ġdid biex toħroġ allokazzjoni ġdida.",
  "All three steps completed. Every transaction is verifiable on Solscan.": "It-tliet passi kollha tlestew. Kull tranżazzjoni tista' tiġi vverifikata fuq Solscan.",
  "A step failed. Completed steps were compensated automatically — each compensation is a real on-chain transaction.": "Pass falla. Il-passi lesti ġew ikkumpensati awtomatikament — kull kumpens huwa tranżazzjoni reali fuq il-blockchain.",
  "A step failed and compensation did not complete. Manual intervention required.": "Pass falla u l-kumpens ma tlestiex. Meħtieġa intervent manwali.",
  "Unexpected error:": "Żball mhux mistenni:",
  "TOKEN ACCOUNTS": "KONTIJIET TAT-TOKENS",
  "Real SPL token accounts on Solana devnet. Balances update after every run. Each flow moves {0} tokens.": "Kontijiet reali ta' tokens SPL fuq Solana devnet. Il-bilanċi jiġu aġġornati wara kull tħaddim. Kull fluss iċaqlaq {0} tokens.",
  "Mint": "Mint",
