  "FLOW COMPLETED": "FLUSS LEST",
  "— all three steps executed successfully.": "— it-tliet passi kollha ġew eżegwiti b'suċċess.",
  "FAILED AND COMPENSATED": "FALLA U ĠIE KKUMPENSAT",
  "— a step failed; every completed step was compensated by a real on-chain transaction, in reverse order. The final state matches the starting state. The transaction history does not disappear, and it should not: it is the audit trail.": "— pass falla; kull pass lest ġie kkumpensat minn tranżazzjoni reali fuq il-blockchain, f'ordni inversa. L-istat finali jaqbel mal-istat tal-bidu. L-istorja tat-tranżazzjonijiet ma tisparixxix, u m'għandhiex: hija t-traċċa tal-awditu.",
  "COMPENSATION INCOMPLETE": "KUMPENS MHUX KOMPLUT",
  "— a compensating transaction did not confirm. Manual intervention is required. This state is surfaced rather than hidden.": "— tranżazzjoni ta' kumpens ma ġietx ikkonfermata. Meħtieġa intervent manwali. Dan l-istat jintwera minflok ma jinħeba.",
