  "PAY": "ĦALLAS",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Oħloq ordni ta' ħlas fi tliet passi: agħżel is-servizz u l-ammont, agħżel kif trid tħallas, u ikseb id-dettalji eżatti tal-ħlas bin-numru tal-ordni tiegħek.",
